# PathForge AI — Complete End-to-End System Documentation

## Executive Overview
**PathForge AI** is an AI-powered resume auditing and career guidance platform built using the MERN stack (**MongoDB**, **Express.js**, **React 19**, **Node.js**) with **TailwindCSS** and **Vite**.

The project implements a secure, scalable authentication system, database models, session restoration, JWT token rotation with HTTP-only cookies, route protection, and a modern responsive dashboard interface.

---

## Technical Stack Summary

| Domain | Technology / Library | Purpose |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Backend Core** | Node.js + Express v4 | RESTful API framework |
| **Database & ORM** | MongoDB Atlas + Mongoose v8 | Document database & schema validation |
| **Authentication** | JSON Web Tokens (`jsonwebtoken`) + `bcryptjs` | Access/Refresh token handling & password hashing |
| **Cookies & Security** | `cookie-parser`, `helmet`, `cors`, `express-rate-limit` | Secure HTTP-only cookies, CORS, headers, rate limiting |
| **Frontend Core** | React v19 + Vite v8 | Client UI rendering & fast build setup |
| **Routing** | React Router v7 | Dynamic client-side routing & guards |
| **Form & Validation** | React Hook Form + Zod | Schema validation matching server rules |
| **Styling & Icons** | TailwindCSS v3 + Lucide React | Modern dark-mode UI design system & icons |
| **Notifications** | React Hot Toast | Real-time toast feedback |

