## System Architecture & Data Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant React as React Client (AuthContext)
    participant API as Express REST API
    participant DB as MongoDB Database

    Note over User, DB: 1. Registration Flow
    User->>React: Submit Name, Email, Password
    React->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/register
    API->>DB: Check Duplicate Email & Create User
    API->>DB: Automatically Create Linked Settings Document
    API-->>React: 201 Created (Sanitized User)
    React-->>User: Toast success -> Redirect to /login

    Note over User, DB: 2. Login Flow
    User->>React: Submit Credentials
    React->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>DB: Verify Password & Store RefreshToken
    API-->>React: 200 OK + Set HTTP-only Access & Refresh Cookies
    React->>API: GET /api/v1/auth/me (Immediate Validation)
    API-->>React: 200 OK (Current User Object)
    React-->>User: Set Auth state -> Redirect to /dashboard

    Note over User, DB: 3. Session Restoration & Silent Refresh
    User->>React: Reload Page / Open Application
    React->>API: GET /api/v1/auth/me
    alt Access Token Expired (401)
        React->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
        API->>DB: Verify RefreshToken & Rotate Tokens
        API-->>React: Set New Rotated Token Cookies
        React->>API: Retry GET /api/v1/auth/me
    end
    API-->>React: 200 OK (User Object)
    React-->>User: Session restored (isAuthenticated = true)
```

