### Database Models

#### `User` Schema ([User.model.js](file:///e:/PATHFORGE/server/models/User.model.js))
- `name`: String, required, trimmed, min 2, max 50 chars.
- `email`: String, required, lowercase, unique, trimmed, indexed.
- `password`: String, required, hidden by default (`select: false`), hashed automatically using `bcryptjs` in a `pre("save")` hook.
- `role`: String, enum `['user', 'admin']`, default `'user'`.
- `refreshToken`: String, hidden by default (`select: false`), holds active refresh token for rotation.
- Methods: `comparePassword(candidatePassword)` returns boolean.

#### `Settings` Schema ([Settings.model.js](file:///e:/PATHFORGE/server/models/Settings.model.js))
- `user`: ObjectId, ref `'User'`, required, unique, indexed.
- `theme`: String, enum `['dark', 'light', 'system']`, default `'dark'`.
- `notifications`: Object with email and in-app toggles.
- Automatically generated upon user registration in `auth.service.js`.

### API Endpoints Reference

| Method | Endpoint | Protection | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/register` | Public | Validates payload, checks unique email, creates User + Settings documents. |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/login` | Public | Verifies credentials, stores refresh token, sets `accessToken` & `refreshToken` HTTP-only cookies. |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/refresh` | Public | Validates incoming refresh cookie, checks DB match, performs **Refresh Token Rotation**, updates cookies. |
| `POST` | `/api/v1/auth/logout` | Public/Auth | Clears `refreshToken` in DB and deletes HTTP-only auth cookies. |
| `GET` | `/api/v1/auth/me` | Protected (`authMiddleware`) | Returns current authenticated user object. |

